      "writtenOn": "2024-10-01T14:22:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/sonivox/arm-wt-22k/lib_src/eas_ota.c;l\u003d47?q\u003dOTA_SOUND\n\nOTA_SOUND is 0x1d and OTA_UNICODE is 0x22.\n\nComment says last cmd needs to be 0x1d for it to be a valid file.\nThis is as per\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/sonivox/arm-wt-22k/lib_src/eas_ota.c;l\u003d222;drc\u003d2fa59c8c6851b453271f33f254c7549fa79d07fb\n\nplease note,  OTA_CheckFileType  returns SUCCESS even when the last command is not OTA_SOUND, but the ppHandle is initialized only when it ends with OTA_SOUND and this is what is used to decide if the file is recognized correctly.",
      "parentUuid": "40bcfa8a_a63491b4",
